{
  "name": "FDA Recalls Scraper (Food Enforcement Data) — daily results to Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (2 minutes)\n1. **Apify credential** — in the `Run the Actor` node create a *Header Auth* credential: header `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN` (<https://console.apify.com/account/integrations>). The token lives in your n8n credential, never in this file.\n2. **Google Sheet** — in `Append rows to Google Sheet` paste your spreadsheet URL and tab name, and pick the Google credential n8n asks for.\n3. **Input** — edit the JSON body of `Run the Actor` (see the README), then activate.\n\nWorkflow by [Steadfetch](https://apify.com/steadfetch) — *web data that doesn't break*.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "0305f799-534d-5b5f-9d38-e6be74efc2dd",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -780,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 7
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "3d410bdb-4c1f-5f72-93b5-d486552f75d7",
      "name": "Every morning at 07:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -560,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/steadfetch~fda-recall-monitor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-01\",\n  \"maxResults\": 100,\n  \"monitorMode\": true,\n  \"strictSchema\": true\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "7a91cc8e-5f9a-571f-9ff3-0a10f1757a29",
      "name": "Run the Actor",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -280,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 10000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "columns": {
          "value": {},
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData"
        },
        "options": {},
        "operation": "append",
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Sheet1"
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/PASTE_YOUR_SHEET_URL"
        }
      },
      "id": "a68aef27-5e32-5df9-a107-09d1ad41372f",
      "name": "Append rows to Google Sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every morning at 07:00": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Run the Actor",
